nual/html_node/emacs/Specifying-File-Variables.html\u003e\n全然気づきませんでした。人の init.el も読んできたはずなのですが","ts":"1620039574.200700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xisq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18e360fd-9d8a-4503-befe-34edcd46c109","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"setq-defaultはグローバルですね。それだと多分困るので、バッファローカルにしてはどうですか？ということですね。","ts":"1620039481.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gaI9E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5b74d3f-444f-45ea-a661-bcd0cbb9c119","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```;; Local Variables:\n;; indent-tabs-mode: nil\n;; lisp-body-indent: 4\n;; End:\n\n;;; init.el ends here```\nこんな感じです。","ts":"1620039451.199400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3aWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5605ccd6-eb1f-447f-b73f-986e48915c20","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"グローバルなつもりでしたが、 `setq-default` はバッファローカル？　でしたっけ","ts":"1620039447.199300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nzQ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8cabc81-efac-4713-bacd-df3dd6d698c4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"グローバル設定でインデントを他の人と違うように設定すると、やっぱりコントリビュート困りますよね。。\n自分のファイルでどんなインデントを使うも自由ですが、ファイルローカルに設定すると良いかもしれませんー。","ts":"1620039388.198400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mJc7/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa31fb95-1b8a-4524-89d2-fe9cde28d615","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"これは…… init.el を吹き飛ばして leaf 入門をおすすめされている？！","ts":"1620039285.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kzk","count":4,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id